---
title: "Crazy Seal's copy of Shopify orders"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Up to date
    lg1: Catching up
    lg2: Breaks NothingLeftBehind
    lg3: Path to the NothingLeftBehind bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Our copy matches Shopify
  s1: An order is behind Shopify, the next refresh will fetch it
  s2: An order is behind Shopify, and no refresh will fetch it
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an order changes in Shopify
  s1 --> s1: a minute passes or a new order comes in
  s1 --> s2: staff open the new order, which copies it
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
